    "IMPORTANT: pass affiliations change EVERY season. Resorts join, leave, and",
    "move between access tiers; Ikon in particular reshuffles its 5/7-day tiers",
    "annually. Treat this file as a snapshot with a known expiry, not as truth.",
    "Re-verify against ikonpass.com/destinations and epicpass.com before each",
    "season and bump `season`. `yarn verify:passes` reports entries that matched",
    "no resort, which is the usual signal that a name or roster has changed.",
    "",
    "`match` entries are case-insensitive substring tests against the OpenSkiMap",
    "resort name. They are deliberately loose because upstream names are messy",
